        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eric Bloom, Otep Shamaya, Michael Moorcock\n- Organizations: Blue Öyster Cult, Otep\n- Products: \"Veteran of the Psychic Wars\"\n- Concepts: Elric of Melniboné, nu metal, hard rock\n\nFacts:\n- Eric Bloom was born on December 1, 1944, and he is an American singer, songwriter, and musician.\n- Otep Shamaya is the lead vocalist of the nu metal band Otep.\n- \"Veteran of the Psychic Wars\" is a song by the American hard rock band Blue Öyster Cult.\n- Eric Bloom and British author Michael Moorcock wrote \"Veteran of the Psychic Wars.\"\n- Michael Moorcock is the creator of Elric of Melniboné.",
